# Vanadium · V · gate 23

**Vanadium** (V) is element **23** of the periodic table — a **transition metal**, period 4, group 5, d-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **50.942**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
Toughens steel; the redox-flow battery; a chemist's rainbow of oxidation colors.

